# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# Any sidecar of .env, whatever the suffix. The three patterns above missed
# `.env.bak-<timestamp>`, which sat untracked on the production box holding
# live ANTHROPIC/OPENAI/GEMINI keys and a GITHUB_TOKEN — one `git add -A`
# from being committed. `.env.example` is force-added and stays tracked.
.env.*
!.env.example

